    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 2.6,
      "end_time": 4.9,
      "text": "(That's right... I finally remember.)"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 5.6,
      "end_time": 7.2,
      "text": "(The three of us...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 7.9,
      "end_time": 9.1,
      "text": "(We're normal girls...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 10.5,
      "end_time": 11.8,
      "text": "(We're idols...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 12.6,
      "end_time": 14.2,
      "text": "(We're \"New Generations\"...)"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 15.0,
      "end_time": 16.2,
      "text": "(And of course...!)"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 17.0,
      "end_time": 18.6,
      "text": "We are..."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 21.7,
      "end_time": 23.7,
      "text": "Cinderella Girls!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 34.2,
      "end_time": 39.4,
      "text": "♪ We'll follow our future compass, and on goes the journey ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 39.6,
      "end_time": 44.4,
      "text": "♪ Whatever the adventure, we'll be OK if we're together ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 44.6,
      "end_time": 49.4,
      "text": "♪ So believe in us and you'll see our earnest power ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 49.6,
      "end_time": 54.6,
      "text": "♪ Reaching out to the world, hoping to make them smile ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 54.8,
      "end_time": 61.4,
      "text": "♪ Our voices ring out, filling the crowd with a brilliant surround sound! ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 87.2,
      "end_time": 88.2,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 88.6,
      "end_time": 89.4,
      "text": "Pinya..."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 91.7,
